OL,4,CPROGRAMMES
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1970FThe Morecambe and Wise Show
OL,7,F(45-minute special) first airs on BBC
OL,8,FOne.
OL,9,
OL,10,FThe show had previously been broadcast
OL,11,Fon BBC Two (September 1968 - August
OL,12,F1970).
OL,13,
OL,14,FThe programme was missing from the BBC
OL,15,Farchives. In 2020, Eric Morecambe's son
OL,16,FGary found a can of film in his
OL,17,Ffather's attic. Some of the footage was
OL,18,Fincluded in the ITN production
OL,19,FMorecambe and Wise: The Lost Tapes,
OL,20,Fwhich aired on ITV on 28th July 2021.
OL,21,
OL,22,
OL,23,Sppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
