OL,3,CTV-related anniversaries for 08 OCT
OL,4,CPROGRAMMES
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1984FBBC Two introduces an afternoon
OL,7,Fprogramme service, to plug the gap
OL,8,Fbetween the end of schools programmes
OL,9,Fand the start of the early evening
OL,10,Fschedule. This is undoubtedly a
OL,11,Freaction to Channel 4's impending
OL,12,Fextension of broadcast hours.
OL,13,
OL,14,FBBC Two filled the post-schools slot
OL,15,Fwith repeats (including episodes of
OL,16,FDallas initially) and live sport. By
OL,17,Fearly January 1985, the 3pm - 5.25pm
OL,18,Fslot was occupied by Pages from Ceefax.
OL,19,
OL,20,CG1986FThe first edition of Animal
OL,21,FSquad airs on BBC One.
OL,22,
OL,23,Sppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
